# migrations/versions/

Alembic writes migration scripts here. Each file is named
``YYYYMMDDHHMM_<slug>.py`` and contains both ``upgrade()`` and
``downgrade()``.

This directory is kept in git even when empty (via ``.gitkeep``)
so the alembic init layout is reproducible from a fresh clone.

See DATABASE_DESIGN.md §6 for the ordered migration plan.